tatin\">simvastatin</a> (original brand name <b>Zocor</b>) and <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/sitagliptin\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:sitagliptin\">sitagliptin</a> (brand name <b>Januvia</b>). Simvastatin is a <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/statin\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:statin\">statin</a>\u2014a drug used to lower cholesterol levels, and sitagliptin is a <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dipeptidyl_peptidase-4_inhibitor\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Dipeptidyl peptidase-4 inhibitor\">DPP-4 inhibitor</a>\u2014an oral <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anti-diabetic_medication\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Anti-diabetic medication\">hypoglycemic agent</a>. Created with <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.chemdoodle.com\">ChemDoodle 7.0.2</a> and <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.adobe.com/products/illustrator.html\">Adobe Illustrator CC</a>.","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Artist":{"value":"<a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/User:Vaccinationist\" title=\"User:Vaccinationist\">Vaccinationist</a>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"Public domain","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""}},"mime":"image/svg+xml"}]},"3652612":{"pageid":3652612,"ns":6,"title":"File:Sitagliptin.svg","index":3,"imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"size":7693,"width":512,"height":304,"thumburl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1d/Sitagliptin.svg/960px-Sitagliptin.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","thumbwidth":640,"thumbheight":380,"responsiveUrls":{"2":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1d/Sitagliptin.svg/1280px-Sitagliptin.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail"},"thumbattribs":{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1d/Sitagliptin.svg/960px-Sitagliptin.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&